     F (Z_to_bv 64 pc) fc None m (seg_rom rsegs).

Definition rs_sv (s9 s8 s7 s6 s5 s4 s3 s2 s1 s0 ra : word) : list word := [s9; s8; s7; s6; s5; s4; s3; s2; s1; s0; ra].

